#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:2
msgid "Scene Data Provider"
msgstr "场景数据提供器"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:4
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` bridges physics simulation "
"backends and the visualizers/renderers that consume scene data. It exposes a"
" single Warp-native read path for body transforms and visual geometry "
"regardless of which physics backend is active, so renderers and visualizers "
"can stay backend-agnostic."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` "
"连接物理仿真后端与使用场景数据的可视化器/渲染器。无论启用哪个物理后端，它都提供统一的 Warp "
"原生读取路径，获取刚体变换和可视几何，使渲染器与可视化器无需依赖具体物理后端。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:10
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:12
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports multiple physics backends (PhysX and Newton) and multiple"
" visualizers (Omniverse Kit, Newton, Rerun, Viser). Each combination needs "
"scene data to flow from the physics engine into the renderer or visualizer. "
":class:`SceneDataProvider` owns this flow: the physics manager provides a "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend` that wraps its native tensor "
"views, and the provider handles format conversion and re-mapping on top of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持多个物理后端（PhysX 和 Newton）及可视化器（Omniverse "
"Kit、Newton、Rerun、Viser）。每种组合都需要将场景数据从物理引擎传递到渲染器或可视化器。 "
":class:`SceneDataProvider` 负责这一数据流：物理管理器提供 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend` ，包装原生张量视图；提供器在其上处理格式转换和重新映射。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:27
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:30
msgid "Lazy-read contract"
msgstr "惰性读取约定"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:32
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab.utils.buffers.TimestampedBuffer` to pair cached data "
"with its last successful update timestamp. Owners allocate storage; the "
"container never allocates or converts it. Same-step writes invalidate "
"affected asset caches with ``reset_timestamps`` and advance SDP's "
"publication timestamp. Each consumer compares its own timestamp after "
"requesting data, since resolving a native pointer can itself detect a "
"change. Consumers tracking only an upload need a timestamp, not another copy"
" of SDP's data reference."
msgstr ""
"使用 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.buffers.TimestampedBuffer` "
"将缓存数据与最近一次成功更新的时间戳配对。存储由数据所有者分配，容器本身不分配或转换数据。同一步内的写入通过 ``reset_timestamps`` "
"使受影响的资产缓存失效，并推进 SDP "
"的发布时间戳。请求数据后，各使用者比较自己的时间戳，因为解析原生指针本身也可能发现变化。只跟踪上传操作的使用者只需时间戳，无需再保存一份 SDP "
"数据引用。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:39
msgid ""
"SDP readers cache buffers and mapping data with the same timestamp guard "
"used by asset data, without binding factories or stored update callbacks. "
"Matching native arrays bypass conversion. Caller-owned destinations are "
"weakly referenced, so their cached mappings expire when the caller releases "
"them."
msgstr ""
"SDP "
"读取器采用与资产数据相同的时间戳检查机制，缓存缓冲区和映射数据，不使用绑定工厂或存储的更新回调。匹配的原生数组绕过转换。调用方管理的目标仅通过弱引用保存，因此调用方释放目标后，其缓存映射也会失效。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:43
msgid ""
"Pending work belongs to its executor. Newton's ``forward()`` and "
"PhysX/OVPhysX's ``update_kinematics()`` check ``kinematics_dirty`` "
"internally and clear it after success; readers call the operation without "
"inspecting its guard. Reordered articulation views still refresh their own "
"derived arrays. Sensors and Newton's shared BVH similarly use dirty flags, "
"while device masks select the environments requiring work. Keep eager "
"contact reads to detect contact loss."
msgstr ""
"待执行工作由其执行者管理。Newton 的 ``forward()`` 和 PhysX/OVPhysX 的 "
"``update_kinematics()`` 在内部检查 ``kinematics_dirty`` "
"，成功后清除；读取器直接调用操作，无需检查该标志。重排后的关节体视图仍会刷新自身的派生数组。传感器和 Newton 共享 BVH "
"同样使用脏标志，设备掩码选择需要处理的环境。应保留即时接触读取，以检测接触消失。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:49
msgid ""
"Sampling periods and finite differences use simulation time [s]; Fabric "
"geometry cadence uses render frames. Neither is a publication counter. "
"Python guards do not execute during CUDA graph replay: captured work must "
"remain in the graph or use device-side invalidation. Newton retains its "
"selective reset masks and conservative reads after externally replayed "
"writes."
msgstr ""
"采样周期和有限差分使用仿真时间 [s]；Fabric 几何更新周期使用渲染帧数。两者都不是发布计数器。CUDA 图回放时不会执行 Python "
"条件检查，因此捕获的工作必须保留在图中，或使用设备端失效机制。Newton 保留选择性重置掩码，并在外部回放写入后采用保守读取。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:55
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "数据流"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:57
msgid "The system has three layers:"
msgstr "系统有三层："

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:59
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend`: a small interface "
"implemented by each physics manager. It exposes the backend's transform "
"array directly as one of the :class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataFormat` "
"Warp structs, plus the per-transform prim paths and total count. Producers "
"increment ``transforms_timestamp`` after native state writes or buffer "
"swaps; SDP calls ``get_transforms(output_format)`` before reading the "
"timestamp, since resolving the pointer can itself detect a swap. The default"
" implementation returns the existing ``transforms`` property. This is a "
"logical publication timestamp, not elapsed time. It never resets within the "
"backend's lifetime, so independent readers cannot hide changes from one "
"another."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend` ：各物理管理器实现的小型接口。它将后端变换数组直接作为 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataFormat` 中的一种 Warp 结构提供，同时给出每个变换的 prim "
"路径和总数。原生状态写入或缓冲区交换后，数据生产者递增 ``transforms_timestamp`` 。SDP 在读取时间戳前调用 "
"``get_transforms(output_format)`` ，因为解析指针本身可能检测到交换。默认实现返回已有的 ``transforms`` "
"属性。这是逻辑发布时间戳，不是经过的时间，在后端生命周期内不会重置，因此独立读取器不会相互掩盖变化。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:68
msgid ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transforms`: the native data as a Warp struct (one "
"of :class:`SceneDataFormat.Vec3_Quat`, :class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform`, "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Matrix44`, :class:`SceneDataFormat.Vec3_Matrix33`)."
msgstr ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transforms` ：Warp 结构形式的原生数据（ "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Vec3_Quat` 、 :class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform` 、 "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Matrix44` 或 :class:`SceneDataFormat.Vec3_Matrix33` "
"）。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:71
msgid ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transforms_timestamp`: logical update timestamp of "
"the native transforms."
msgstr ":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transforms_timestamp` ：原生变换的逻辑更新时间戳。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:72
msgid ":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transform_count`: number of transforms."
msgstr ":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transform_count` ：变换数量。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:73
msgid ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transform_paths`: list of USD prim paths, one per "
"transform."
msgstr ":attr:`SceneDataBackend.transform_paths` ：USD prim 路径列表，每个变换对应一个路径。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:74
msgid ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.native_transform_formats`: formats published without"
" conversion. PhysX publishes either packed poses or Fabric matrices and "
"refreshes only the requested representation."
msgstr ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.native_transform_formats` ：无需转换即可提供的格式。PhysX 提供打包位姿或"
" Fabric 矩阵，只刷新请求的表示形式。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:76
msgid ""
":meth:`SceneDataBackend.get_geometry_batches`: native point arrays or "
"interpolation inputs, paired with exact visual prim paths and ranges "
"compiled during backend construction. It returns the requested native "
"representation when available, otherwise the primary representations for SDP"
" to convert. The return type is always a list of batches, including native "
"Fabric."
msgstr ""
":meth:`SceneDataBackend.get_geometry_batches` ：原生点数组或插值输入，配对后端构建时编译得到的精确可视 "
"prim 路径和范围。请求的原生表示可用时直接返回，否则返回主要表示，由 SDP 转换。返回类型始终为批次列表，包括原生 Fabric 情况。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:80
msgid ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.geometry_timestamp`: logical update timestamp, "
"advanced for same-step writes and native pointer swaps. Cached outputs "
"record the timestamp they contain, like asset data buffers. This is not "
"elapsed simulation time or a shared dirty flag that a reader clears."
msgstr ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.geometry_timestamp` "
"：逻辑更新时间戳，同一步内的写入和原生指针交换都会推进它。与资产数据缓冲区一样，缓存输出记录其所包含数据的时间戳。这不是已过的仿真时间，也不是由某个读取器清除的共享脏标志。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:83
msgid ""
":attr:`SceneDataBackend.native_geometry_formats`: geometry formats available"
" without conversion."
msgstr ":attr:`SceneDataBackend.native_geometry_formats` ：无需转换即可获得的几何格式。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:85
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider`: wraps a backend and offers "
"format conversion plus index re-mapping."
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` ：包装后端，提供格式转换和索引重新映射。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:88
msgid ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.get_transforms`: binds native arrays when format "
"and ordering match, or SDP-owned buffers converted once per producer "
"timestamp and destination layout. These shared arrays are read-only, "
"including when they replace preallocated output fields. Pass "
"``allow_passthrough=False`` to write directly into caller-owned arrays "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.get_transforms` ：格式与顺序匹配时绑定原生数组，否则绑定 SDP "
"管理的缓冲区；对每个生产者时间戳和目标布局只转换一次。这些共享数组只读，即使它们替换了预分配的输出字段。传入 "
"``allow_passthrough=False`` ，则直接写入调用方管理的数组。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:92
msgid ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.create_mapping`: builds a remap array from the "
"backend's prim paths to a consumer's desired ordering. Used when a renderer "
"or visualizer wants transforms indexed by its own body list rather than by "
"the physics view order."
msgstr ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.create_mapping` ：构建从后端 prim "
"路径到使用者期望顺序的重映射数组。当渲染器或可视化器希望按自己的刚体列表、而非物理视图顺序索引变换时使用。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:95
msgid ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.get_geometry_points`: read-only world-space point "
"views keyed by exact visual prim path. Native point ranges alias the "
"producer; interpolation and destination reordering are fused into one cached"
" conversion. Consumers with fixed native storage pass that array or "
"``FabricPoints`` as ``output`` and visual-path offsets as ``offsets``. These"
" calls return the supplied destination. Destination caches retain indexing "
"metadata, not the consumer's buffers, and expire with the destination."
msgstr ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.get_geometry_points` ：按精确可视 prim "
"路径索引的只读世界空间点视图。原生点范围直接引用生产者数据；插值与目标重排融合为一次缓存转换。使用固定原生存储的使用者，将该数组或 "
"``FabricPoints`` 作为 ``output`` ，将可视路径偏移作为 ``offsets`` "
"传入。调用返回所提供的目标。目标缓存保留索引元数据，不保留使用者缓冲区，并随目标释放而失效。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:101
msgid ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.get_camera_transforms`: discovers per-camera, per-"
"env world transforms from the USD stage."
msgstr ""
":meth:`SceneDataProvider.get_camera_transforms` ：从 USD 舞台发现各相机、各环境的世界变换。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:103
msgid ""
":attr:`SceneDataProvider.num_envs`: environment count inferred from "
"``/World/envs/env_<id>`` prims."
msgstr ""
":attr:`SceneDataProvider.num_envs` ：从 ``/World/envs/env_<id>`` prim 推断的环境数量。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:106
msgid "Backend implementations:"
msgstr "后端实现："

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:108
msgid ""
"``PhysxSceneDataBackend`` (internal to :mod:`isaaclab_physx.physics`) wraps "
"PhysX's ``RigidBodyView`` and exposes its transforms as "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform`. When deformable bodies are present it "
"also exposes flattened simulation nodal positions through "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Points`."
msgstr ""
"``PhysxSceneDataBackend`` （位于 :mod:`isaaclab_physx.physics` 内部）包装 PhysX 的 "
"``RigidBodyView`` ，以 :class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform` 提供变换。存在可变形物体时，还通过 "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Points` 提供展平的仿真节点位置。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:112
msgid ""
"``OvPhysxSceneDataBackend`` (internal to :mod:`isaaclab_ov.physics`) mirrors"
" the PhysX contract for rigid transforms and OVPhysX deformable nodal "
"tensors."
msgstr ""
"``OvPhysxSceneDataBackend`` （位于 :mod:`isaaclab_ov.physics` 内部）对刚体变换和 OVPhysX"
" 可变形节点张量采用与 PhysX 相同的约定。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:114
msgid ""
"``NewtonSceneDataBackend`` (internal to :mod:`isaaclab_newton.physics`) "
"wraps the Newton model's ``body_q`` and exposes it as "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform`."
msgstr ""
"``NewtonSceneDataBackend`` （位于 :mod:`isaaclab_newton.physics` 内部）包装 Newton "
"模型的 ``body_q`` ，以 :class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform` 提供。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:118
msgid "PhysX backend"
msgstr "PhysX 后端"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:120
msgid ""
"When PhysX is the active physics backend, the provider reads transforms "
"directly from PhysX's ``RigidBodyView`` (a wildcard-expanded tensor view "
"covering every rigid body across all envs). The transforms are returned as "
":class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform` (Warp ``transformf`` array), so consumers"
" that want this format get them zero-copy."
msgstr ""
"使用 PhysX 物理后端时，提供器直接从 PhysX 的 ``RigidBodyView`` "
"读取变换，这是一个经通配符展开、覆盖所有环境中全部刚体的张量视图。变换以 :class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform` "
"（Warp ``transformf`` 数组）返回，因此需要这种格式的使用者可零拷贝获取数据。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:125
msgid ""
"Newton-native consumers (Newton visualizer, Rerun, Viser, Newton Warp "
"renderer) also need a Newton ``Model``/``State``. Their declared cloning "
"contexts construct that representation from the shared clone plan before "
"initialization. Its rigid ``body_q`` binds to SDP's requested ``Transform`` "
"array; no intermediate per-frame copy into a second state buffer is "
"required. OVRTX requests ``TransposedMatrix44d`` directly from SDP, "
"including destination ordering and static scale in the same conversion. It "
"no longer reads Newton state for rigid transforms. For deformables with "
"different simulation and visual meshes, the producer compiles barycentric "
"indices and weights from the declared prototype once. SDP applies that "
"interpolation directly into the Newton representation's final ``particle_q``"
" slots. There is no intermediate simulation-sized buffer and no consumer-"
"owned remap. Native PhysX padded nodal arrays are borrowed without packing."
msgstr ""
"Newton 原生使用者（Newton 可视化器、Rerun、Viser、Newton Warp 渲染器）还需要 Newton "
"``Model``/``State`` 。它们声明的克隆上下文在初始化前，根据共享克隆计划构建该表示。刚体 ``body_q`` 绑定 SDP 请求的 "
"``Transform`` 数组，无需每帧再拷贝到第二个状态缓冲区。OVRTX 直接向 SDP 请求 ``TransposedMatrix44d`` "
"，在同一次转换中处理目标顺序和静态缩放，不再从 Newton "
"状态读取刚体变换。对于仿真网格与可视网格不同的可变形物体，生产者根据声明的原型只编译一次重心坐标索引和权重。SDP 将插值结果直接写入 Newton "
"表示最终的 ``particle_q`` 槽位，无需中间的仿真规模缓冲区，也无需使用者自行重映射。原生 PhysX "
"带填充的节点数组直接借用，无需重新打包。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:136
msgid ""
"OVRTX receives the same exact visual-path publications through SDP. It "
"neither imports Newton managers nor requests a Newton model. Meshes, "
"particle clouds, and cable curves use one point-binding path."
msgstr ""
"OVRTX 通过 SDP 接收同样的精确可视路径数据。它不导入 Newton 管理器，也不请求 Newton "
"模型。网格、粒子云和线缆曲线使用统一的点绑定路径。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:140
msgid ""
"PhysX owns its native Fabric refresh and publishes the resulting matrices "
"through SDP without fetching packed poses. "
"``isaaclab_physx.renderers.fabric.FabricBackend`` owns the shared native "
"stage and hierarchy handles. Its identity is the stage and device, not the "
"SDP source or attribute type. After physics initializes, Kit, Isaac RTX, and"
" explicit Fabric synchronization obtain the same resource through "
"``sim.get_or_create_backend(FabricBackendCfg(stage=sim.stage, "
"device=sim.device))``. The simulation registry does not need to know which "
"backends exist. Transform bindings are state on that resource, not a "
"separate backend. Consumers pass the simulation's SDP to "
"``update_transforms(provider)``; for foreign physics it converts directly "
"into Fabric local matrices, then propagates the GPU hierarchy. Core "
"``RenderContext`` owns no Fabric bindings. It binds rigid destinations as "
"Fabric-only reset-stack roots because physics publishes absolute poses, "
"including for nested bodies. Visual descendants still inherit their body's "
"transform; authored USD is unchanged. Native source indices and world scales"
" are bound once. Fabric's selection reuse API reports scene-wide structural "
"changes; the resource refreshes array views without repeating path matching "
"or scale capture. Otherwise GPU propagation reuses the hierarchy topology. "
"Clean requests never acquire writable Fabric arrays. Renderers do not select"
" a physics-specific synchronization path. The same Fabric resource receives "
"geometry through ``update_geometries(provider, frame)``. PhysX publishes its"
" native ``FabricPoints`` without a conversion or rewrite. Foreign mesh "
"points are interpolated directly into GPU Fabric storage. The current Kit "
"Hydra path requires CPU Fabric destinations for ``Points`` and "
"``BasisCurves``; SDP handles their device transfer without USD attribute "
"writes. Only destinations whose update interval has elapsed are transferred."
" World-space point destinations reset their transform stack to avoid "
"applying the environment or body pose twice. ``FabricMatrix44`` and "
"``FabricPoints`` contain only array storage, not bindings or native engine "
"handles."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 负责原生 Fabric 刷新，并通过 SDP 提供所得矩阵，无需获取打包位姿。 "
"``isaaclab_physx.renderers.fabric.FabricBackend`` "
"管理共享的原生舞台和层级句柄。该资源由舞台和设备唯一标识，而非 SDP 来源或属性类型。物理初始化后，Kit、Isaac RTX 和显式 Fabric "
"同步通过 ``sim.get_or_create_backend(FabricBackendCfg(stage=sim.stage, "
"device=sim.device))`` 获取同一资源。仿真注册表无需预先知道存在哪些后端。变换绑定是该资源上的状态，不是独立后端。使用者将仿真的 "
"SDP 传给 ``update_transforms(provider)`` ；对于其他物理后端，它直接转换为 Fabric 局部矩阵，再传播 GPU "
"层级。核心 ``RenderContext`` 不管理 Fabric 绑定。由于物理提供绝对位姿（嵌套刚体也如此），它将刚体目标绑定为仅在 Fabric"
" 中重置变换栈的根节点。可视后代仍继承所属刚体的变换，已编写的 USD 不变。原生源索引和世界缩放只绑定一次。Fabric 的选择复用 API "
"报告场景级结构变化；资源刷新数组视图，无需重复路径匹配或缩放获取。其他情况下，GPU 传播复用层级拓扑。没有变化的请求从不获取可写 Fabric "
"数组。渲染器不选择特定物理后端的同步路径。同一 Fabric 资源通过 ``update_geometries(provider, frame)`` "
"接收几何。PhysX 直接提供原生 ``FabricPoints`` ，无需转换或重写。其他后端的网格点直接插值到 GPU Fabric 存储中。当前 "
"Kit Hydra 路径要求 ``Points`` 和 ``BasisCurves`` 使用 CPU Fabric 目标，SDP 负责设备传输，无需写入"
" USD 属性。只传输已到更新间隔的目标。世界空间点目标会重置变换栈，避免重复应用环境或刚体位姿。 ``FabricMatrix44`` 和 "
"``FabricPoints`` 仅包含数组存储，不包含绑定或原生引擎句柄。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:167
msgid "Newton backend"
msgstr "Newton 后端"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:169
msgid ""
"When Newton is the active physics backend, the backend wraps the Newton "
"model's ``body_q`` directly. No shadow model or per-frame sync is needed: "
"Newton already owns the authoritative model and state, and the provider "
"exposes that state as :class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform`."
msgstr ""
"使用 Newton 物理后端时，后端直接包装 Newton 模型的 ``body_q`` 。无需影子模型或逐帧同步：Newton "
"已管理权威模型和状态，提供器将该状态以 :class:`SceneDataFormat.Transform` 暴露。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:173
msgid ""
"Native reads reconcile pending authored state writes once. A new physics "
"publication does not itself request forward kinematics. Kit/RTX requests "
"current Fabric transforms through SDP before rendering, without issuing an "
"additional physics ``forward()``. Headless viewport capture requests these "
"transforms on demand rather than on every visualizer step."
msgstr ""
"原生读取会统一处理待生效的状态写入，只执行一次。新的物理数据发布本身不要求执行正向运动学。Kit/RTX 在渲染前通过 SDP 请求当前 Fabric "
"变换，无需额外调用物理 ``forward()`` 。无界面视口采集按需请求这些变换，而非每个可视化器步都请求。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:178
msgid ""
"Externally replayed CUDA graphs do not call Python write hooks. After writes"
" have been captured, Newton conservatively republishes transforms when read "
"so an unannounced replay cannot leave rendering stale. Those reads do not "
"benefit from clean-publication caching."
msgstr ""
"外部回放的 CUDA 图不会调用 Python 写入钩子。写入被捕获后，Newton "
"会在读取时保守地重新发布变换，避免未通知的回放使渲染数据过时。这类读取无法利用未变化数据的发布缓存。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:183
msgid "Geometry publication"
msgstr "几何数据发布"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:185
msgid ""
"Newton deformable and MPM positions are direct views of native "
"``particle_q`` ranges. Cable publications borrow native body poses and "
"capsule parameters; SDP derives curve endpoints once per update timestamp. "
"Both camera renderers and viewers consume the same cached result."
msgstr ""
"Newton 可变形物体和 MPM 的位置是原生 ``particle_q`` 范围的直接视图。线缆数据借用原生刚体位姿和胶囊体参数，SDP "
"对每个更新时间戳只计算一次曲线端点。相机渲染器和查看器使用同一缓存结果。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:189
msgid ""
"``ClonePlan`` remains a generic replication and routing description. Asset "
"construction authors prototype geometry; native import combines those "
"prototypes with the plan and records native ranges. Consumers bind to those "
"completed resources, never rediscovering the completed stage."
msgstr ""
"``ClonePlan`` "
"始终是通用的复制与分发描述。资产构造时编写原型几何，原生导入将这些原型与计划组合，并记录原生范围。使用者绑定到这些已完成的资源，不会再次遍历已完成的舞台进行发现。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:204
msgid ""
"The internal flat-node queries and physics-owned geometry sync methods were "
"removed. Rendering consumers use ``get_geometry_points``; physics managers "
"no longer run geometry writers from ``pre_render``."
msgstr ""
"内部的展平节点查询和由物理管理的几何同步方法已移除。渲染使用者改用 ``get_geometry_points`` ；物理管理器不再从 "
"``pre_render`` 运行几何写入器。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:207
msgid ""
"Transform conversion caches use "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.buffers.TimestampedBuffer`, the same data-and-"
"timestamp container used by asset data. Storage is allocated only when "
"conversion is needed; freshness is committed after conversion succeeds. "
"Native matching formats still pass through without allocation. Fabric "
"destination replacement invalidates the cached binding even if physics is "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"变换转换缓存使用 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.buffers.TimestampedBuffer` "
"，与资产数据使用相同的数据/时间戳容器。仅在需要转换时分配存储，转换成功后才确认数据已更新。匹配的原生格式仍直接传递，不分配存储。即使物理状态未变，更换"
" Fabric 目标也会使缓存绑定失效。"

#: source/developer-tools/scene_data_providers.rst:212
msgid ""
"As in articulation and rigid-object data, the current timestamp and a cached"
" buffer's timestamp serve different purposes: one identifies current state; "
"the other identifies the state in that buffer. Asset data advances "
"``_sim_timestamp`` with time and invalidates dependent buffers on same-step "
"writes. SDP instead advances ``geometry_timestamp`` on those writes, so "
"independently updated consumers all see the change. The output's cache owns "
"its freshness check; a downstream upload or BVH may need its own "
"invalidation, but should not repeat the conversion's cache bookkeeping."
msgstr ""
"与关节体和刚体物体数据一样，当前时间戳与缓存缓冲区时间戳用途不同：一个标识当前状态，另一个标识缓冲区中的状态。资产数据随时间推进 "
"``_sim_timestamp`` ，并在同一步内写入时使依赖缓冲区失效。SDP 则在这些写入时推进 ``geometry_timestamp`` "
"，使独立更新的使用者都能看到变化。输出缓存负责自身的新鲜度检查；下游上传或 BVH 可能需要自己的失效机制，但不应重复管理转换缓存的状态。"

